<title>POLAND: Analysts value Polish KGHM at $1-$1.5 bln -paper.</title>
<headline>Analysts value Polish KGHM at $1-$1.5 bln -paper.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five leading investment banks value Poland's copper firm KGHM Polska Miedz SA, whose public offering begins on June 30, at between $1 billion and $1.5 billion, the Rzeczpospolita daily reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Following are estimations of KGHM's value and forecasts of its financial results over the next three years (in million dollars).</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch:</p>
<p>					 1997	 1998     1999</p>
<p>		 sales		4,016	4,327    4,523</p>
<p>  operating profit		  828	  911	960</p>
<p>	  net profit		  380	  455	484</p>
<p>		 value			 1,100 - 1,300</p>
<p>Creditanstalt Investment Bank (consolidated results):</p>
<p>					 1997	 1998     1999</p>
<p>		 sales		4,060	4,520    4,925</p>
<p>  operating profit		  445	  575	680</p>
<p>	  net profit		  307	  381	453</p>
<p>		 value			 1,000 - 1,300</p>
<p>BZW (consolidated results):</p>
<p>					 1997	 1998     1999</p>
<p>		 sales		3,987	4,499    5,044</p>
<p>  operating profit		  600	  686	863</p>
<p>	  net profit		  340	  421	537</p>
<p>		 value			    1,155 - 1,483</p>
<p>Flemings:</p>
<p>					  1997	1998	1999</p>
<p>		 sales		 3,963     4,221     4,753</p>
<p>  operating profit		   578	 577	 909</p>
<p>	  net profit		   328	 333	 549</p>
<p>		 value			    1,100 - 1,350</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>Paribas:				1997	1998	1999</p>
<p>		 sales		  3,862     4,162     4,529</p>
<p>  operating profit		    404	 467	 637</p>
<p>	  net profit		    284	 320	 401</p>
<p>		 value			     1,100 - 1,500</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
